  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f101" contextRef="c1">&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 107.9%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;letter-spacing: 1pt;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;PAGE 122&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 107.9%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0.44in;margin-top: 0;text-indent: -0.25in;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;letter-spacing: 1pt;;display:inline;"&gt;1.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;letter-spacing: 1pt;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="spacecount: 4;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;letter-spacing: 1pt;;display:inline;"&gt;BALANCE SHEET&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, &#39;serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 107.9%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0.44in;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div  style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;letter-spacing: 1pt;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 107.9%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0.19in;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;letter-spacing: 1pt;;display:inline;"&gt;At March 31, 2026, the provision for the asset retirement obligation for the Harvest Alaska, LLC was $126,298,834.&amp;#160;The provision has been estimated using existing technology, at current prices and is expected to be incurred over the next 33 years.&am